<title>USA: ConAgra to split stock two-for-one.</title>
<headline>ConAgra to split stock two-for-one.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>ConAgra Inc, a diversified food company, said Friday its board of directors has approved a two-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>The stock dividend is effective October 1 for shareholders of record September 5, the company said.  </p>
<p>The board also declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.275 a share, unchanged from the previous quarter, the company said.</p>
<p>The cash dividend is payable September 1 to shareholders of record August 1, the company said.</p>
<p>ConAgra shares were up 1-1/2 at 66-3/8 Friday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
